# Four-eyes review (R9.4). Changes to the compliance register, policy, and
# eval set require review. Replace the placeholder handles with two DISTINCT
# real reviewers so no single person can both author and approve an auto-deny.
#
# A confirmed_prohibited_pattern interpretation (which enables a hard deny) is
# only enforceable after such a review merges and CI passes — never written by
# the running system.

# The compliance register (requirements + human interpretations).
/requirements/      @org/ai-governance @org/isms
/interpretations/   @org/ai-governance @org/isms

# Policy and its signed data (thresholds, confirmed prohibited patterns).
/policy/            @org/ai-governance @org/security

# Eval set and fixtures that justify an interpretation.
/eval/              @org/ai-governance
/exemplars/         @org/ai-governance
